WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.432 --> 00:00:02.782
Lesson nine. Shapes!

2
00:00:03.727 --> 00:00:10.777
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:11.742 --> 00:00:13.092
Coco, what's this?

4
00:00:13.142 --> 00:00:16.025
It's a shape! Let's learn shapes!

5
00:00:17.156 --> 00:00:20.456
Circle! Say it with me. Circle!

6
00:00:24.459 --> 00:00:27.758
Square! Say it with me. Square!

7
00:00:31.758 --> 00:00:34.992
Triangle! Say it with me. Triangle!

8
00:00:38.989 --> 00:00:42.290
Star! Say it with me. Star!

9
00:00:46.316 --> 00:00:52.909
Draw a circle in the air! Round and round!

10
00:00:52.959 --> 00:00:56.876
Now draw a triangle! Up, down, and across!

11
00:01:01.248 --> 00:01:07.044
Big! Open your arms wide. Big!

12
00:01:07.094 --> 00:01:11.209
Small! Hands close together. Small!

13
00:01:14.157 --> 00:01:15.607
It's a big circle!

14
00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:21.686
It's a small star!

15
00:01:25.577 --> 00:01:31.475
Shape hunt! The clock is a...

16
00:01:31.525 --> 00:01:32.275
Circle!

17
00:01:32.219 --> 00:01:36.648
The window is a...

18
00:01:36.698 --> 00:01:37.733
Square!

19
00:01:38.475 --> 00:01:45.425
This is I. I is for insect. Insect! I is for igloo. Igloo!

20
00:01:49.413 --> 00:01:56.626
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

21
00:01:56.676 --> 00:01:58.200
Bye-bye, friends!

